   "k": "talk",
   "who": "S.O.C.R.A.T.E.S.",
   "text": "Because you are attempting to metabolize truth.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep12/v06.wav",
   "d": 3.888,
   "e": "0000qozxritxxoozurvoqjmwwsrrskzl23000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "A slow clap from the bleachers. A gorilla in a black trench coat comes down the steps: Deputy Regent Kano, a Gold, one of the men who rule the real world.",
   "see": [
