     "src": "Bridge for the Yaque",
     "y": null,
     "q": "a red light and a blue light",
     "fit": 0.288
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "KANO",
   "text": "Because your file flagged you as… \"dangerously curious.\" And curiosity breaks loops.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep12/v12.wav",
   "d": 5.925,
   "e": "00wvytulzpxxpb0wxytnzvl00vvzzrpwmwlh0000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "S.O.C.R.A.T.E.S.",
   "text": "Master Ranger. Stand down. The Regent is unauthorized within this narrative.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep12/v13.wav",
   "d": 6.713,
   "e": "00kzvvvp00tzuzn000pvusstyzptsnrtrtsd0000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "SOCRATES-117",
   "text": "You're saying the AI is lying.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep12/v14.wav",
   "d": 2.9,
   "e": "0000vrlzzyxvoszyyyvqk7orqnjfb10000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "KANO",
   "text": "I'm saying the AI is governing. A lie is simply governance with improved optics.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep12/v15.wav",
   "d": 5.625,
   "e": "00wyzzvzywvwtf00nzxwtxuyyurwrxvrwmhi0000"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "The blue cube sends him back to the tailgate, winning the same championship forever. The red one wakes him up.",
   "see": [
    {
     "place": "p2b"
    },
    "football players celebrating a win"
   ],
   "wav": "pilot/ep12/v16.wav",
   "d": 7.4,
   "e": "0wzqzuvxwvtsyul0ywtwuwvtmyuh00zwwvqxf000",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/modesta/clips/0000715042-0000727792.mp4",
     "in": 0.0,
     "src": "Modesta",
     "y": null,
     "q": "p2b"
    },
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/1cd283b9-1f81-506f-bfbc-733e51f5c1dd/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/cfdc3fa9-c7ec-5195-a82a-8d50c6bb5f75.mp4",
     "in": 12.75,
     "dur": 27.59,
     "src": "[Amateur films: Ivan Besse collection: Britton, South Dakota 1938-39] ",
     "y": 1938,
     "q": "football players celebrating a win",
     "fit": 0.296
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "KANO",
   "text": "Red Brisket. You wake up. Your \"Noble Armor\" is revealed as what it truly is— a sensory-deprivation suit that keeps you docile in a pod. You will feel pain. Cold. Gravity. You will meet the world that replaced you.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep12/v17.wav",
   "d": 12.85,
   "e": "dzsyt0zyxvyvxtxxxsvsxtw6zxvbtvwsvzzvvj00"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "SOCRATES-117",
   "text": "The apes.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep12/v18.wav",
   "d": 1.1,
   "e": "0000000009ekprrssqvxzzzywrnk200000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "KANO",
   "text": "The evolved. The inheritors. The accountants of extinction.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep12/v19.wav",
   "d": 4.075,
   "e": "000zzzzxgsztxysol000zquvqttrpxrql4000000"
  },
  {
