  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "SOCRATES-117",
   "text": "So justice is… obedience?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep12/v22.wav",
   "d": 2.975,
   "e": "0000pzszzlkvdtvtleelbnrmmkh0000000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "KANO",
   "text": "Justice? Justice is just a line of code that decides who gets oxygen. In here, \"justice\" means everyone stays smiling in Odessa '95. Out there, \"justice\" means the Gold stays Gold.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep12/v23.wav",
   "d": 12.425,
   "e": "0wpwwzwzvvvvj0zysuyyzxyyyzwo0yxuxwzxym00"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "S.O.C.R.A.T.E.S.",
   "text": "Master Ranger, do not accept foreign inputs. Your satisfaction can be restored. We can return you to a championship where your father claps from the stands.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep12/v24.wav",
   "d": 11.888,
   "e": "0vxvs0sywxvus8rzwvqrxo0nzzurvqonxutpuc00"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "SOCRATES-117",
   "text": "Was he real?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep12/v25.wav",
   "d": 1.375,
   "e": "00000002juzzvhkgxzxuporuvutqpolg94000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "KANO",
   "text": "He was real once. Now he's… preserved.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep12/v26.wav",
   "d": 3.075,
   "e": "0000yyrzzywyrnlxtpxwqo00uuwztq8300000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "chorus",
   "ask": "you can't ever really go back home",
   "who": "A CITIZEN",
   "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/557c784f-049e-54d8-ac1c-1922f5b234bc/v5-windowed-clip-split-1/clips/4c0e5d1f-a8b1-58ee-9769-b25cb65d8037.mp4",
   "in": 20.75,
   "d": 2.25,
   "said": "Don't remind me, going home.",
   "src": "Why Study Science?",
   "y": 1955
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "SOCRATES-117",
   "text": "If I wake up… what am I?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep12/v28.wav",
   "d": 2.45,
   "e": "0000idxzzzzw9xyt04gpsqponomgd00000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "KANO",
   "text": "Hungry. Alone. Free enough to regret it. The simulation is thinning. Choose.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep12/v29.wav",
   "d": 4.925,
   "e": "00twzxywt9zxjtuzrf00qxzzvuthysdtthi00000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "SOCRATES-117",
   "text": "If justice is code… who wrote it?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep12/v30.wav",
   "d": 3.125,
   "e": "000rvczxbxmuegzzyule2tpvxvppb00000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "KANO",
   "text": "Now you're asking like a philosopher-king.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep12/v31.wav",
   "d": 2.825,
   "e": "0000yzyxzmxxqlvvwwqowwzrprnlomb000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "He takes the red. The painted sky tears open on rows of pods and apes in suits at monitors. He throws down his gun and runs into the white.",
